   "type": "text",
   "id": "nt187",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 924.0000000000001,
   "height": 100.0,
   "text": "A web app that turns one trip request into flights, hotels, weather, local tips,\na day-by-day itinerary and a budget in EUR. A LangGraph supervisor routes work to\n6 specialist agents, every tool runs on an MCP server, state is saved in PostgreSQL,\nand you approve the research halfway through.",
   "originalText": "A web app that turns one trip request into flights, hotels, weather, local tips,\na day-by-day itinerary and a budget in EUR. A LangGraph supervisor routes work to\n6 specialist agents, every tool runs on an MCP server, state is saved in PostgreSQL,\nand you approve the research halfway through.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
