   "id": "nt260",
   "x": 2190,
   "y": 1750,
   "width": 422.40000000000003,
   "height": 120.0,
   "text": "Two-way arrows: the supervisor routes to a node,\nthe node returns to the supervisor.\nRun order is fixed by AGENT_ORDER (state.py);\nthe LLM only picks WHICH agents run.\nhuman_review is inserted after research\nwhen an itinerary or budget will follow.",
   "originalText": "Two-way arrows: the supervisor routes to a node,\nthe node returns to the supervisor.\nRun order is fixed by AGENT_ORDER (state.py);\nthe LLM only picks WHICH agents run.\nhuman_review is inserted after research\nwhen an itinerary or budget will follow.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2563eb",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
