   "width": 712.8000000000001,
   "height": 60.0,
   "text": "PostgreSQL: 20 checkpoint rows written for this one thread.\nThe pause at step 11 survives a server restart.\nLLM calls in this run: 5 (supervisor, local guide, itinerary, budget, responder).",
