   "width": 756.8000000000001,
   "height": 100.0,
   "text": "NOT protected (found in this scan):\n- no login or auth on the API: anyone who can reach the port spends your API quota\n- no rate limiting   - any client can pass any thread_id to read or resume that thread\n- injection rules are regex heuristics: a rephrased attack can get through\n- python app.py listens on 127.0.0.1 only; Docker listens on 0.0.0.0 (whole network)",
   "originalText": "NOT protected (found in this scan):\n- no login or auth on the API: anyone who can reach the port spends your API quota\n- no rate limiting   - any client can pass any thread_id to read or resume that thread\n- injection rules are regex heuristics: a rephrased attack can get through\n- python app.py listens on 127.0.0.1 only; Docker listens on 0.0.0.0 (whole network)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
